  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 6 results\n\n**z-independence.** At z' = (3/2, 5/4, 3/7) (cells 3-12, 15, 18, 21, 22, 25 re-run, about 100 s): Kvac and K20 are IDENTICAL as exact rational matrices; Pf(C0_0), C0_-1 ^ C0_0, Pf of the pencil column and C0_0 ^ C1_0 are identical polynomials in (al,be,ga); the 64-state checks hold (monomial table 1e-48, overlap identity 1e-48, R2delta / R1 / R3 bracket forms 1e-54). So all loci above are z-independent (K depends on (h, theta) only).\n\n**Other (h, theta).** Cells 3-11 re-run plus the Gauss-chart polynomials; ranks of Kvac, K20 remain 8, 4. In every case Pf(C0_0) = const x be^2 x (be + al ga - c al^2), C0_-1 ^ C0_0 = const x al be (be + al ga) and C0_0 ^ C1_0 = const x al be^2 (be + al ga): only the coefficient c of the quadric changes. With t = theta12/h:\n\n| h | theta | t | c |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1/2 | (2/7, -3/5) | 62/35 | 43/16 |\n| 1/2 | (2/7, 1/5) | 6/35 | 99/128 |\n| 1/2 | (2/7, -26/105) | 16/15 | 29/28 |\n| 1/2 | (2/7, -27/28) | 5/2 | -1/2 |\n| 1/2 | (2/7, -37/42) | 7/3 | -1 |\n| 1/2 | (2/7, -1/70) | 3/5 | 6/7 |\n| 1/3 | (1/7, -16/105) | 31/35 | 37/39 |\n| 1/3 | (1/5, -4/9) | 29/15 | 8 |\n\nAll eight points satisfy c = (t - 3) / (2 (t - 2)) exactly (fitted on the six h = 1/2 points, confirmed on the two h = 1/3 points): c depends on t only, not on h. The genuine (R2delta) component is therefore 2 (t - 2) b1 b3 = (t - 3) b2^2, with b = (1, al, be + al ga), degenerating at t = 3 (b2^2 = 0) and t = 2 (b1 b3 = 0).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### site-1 rotation as ladder-1 brackets — result (2026-10-10)\n\n**Monomial table (exact, 64 states, 1e-47).** psi_x Psi1 = M_x = minor(n,n') v_k(r) for the triple x = (n,n';r) of trip, minor(n,n') := det2[v(n'), v(n)] (n < n'), Psi1 = M_(-3,-2;-1); valid for rows/k = ({1,2},1), ({2,3},3), ({1,3},2). Tensors over (minor, r), minor order (-3,-2),(-3,-1),(-2,-1),(-3,0),(-2,0),(-1,0), r = -3..0: CC0 populated (-3,-2;-1),(-3,-1;-1),(-2,-1;-1),(-3,-2;0),(-3,-1;0),(-3,0;0),(-2,-1;0),(-2,0;0); CC1 populated (-3,-2;-1),(-3,-2;0),(-3,-1;0),(-2,-1;0). Overlap identity <Phi|Psi>/<x0|Psi> Psi1 = sum (CC0 + lambda2 CC1) minor v_k holds to 1e-48.\n\n**Loci (Gauss chart al, be, ga for g = exp(al E12) exp(be E13) exp(ga E23); cone coordinates a = (-be,-ga,1), b = (1,al,be+al ga)).** Pf(C0_{.,0}) = -(4/7533) be^2 (16 be + 16 al ga - 43 al^2); C0_{.,-1} ^ C0_{.,0} = -(32/7533) al be (be + al ga); C0_{.,0} ^ C1_{.,0} = -(280/7533) al be^2 (be + al ga).\n- (R2delta): {be = 0} u {43 b2^2 = 16 b1 b3}; the second component (be = al (43 al/16 - ga)) is a 2-parameter family of genuine rotations, bras F, G explicit at (1,11/16,2), 64-state deviation 1e-53.\n- (R1): al = be = 0 only (1-parameter, degenerate).\n- (R3): {be = 0} u {a3 = 0, 43 b2^2 = 16 b1 b3}; empty for genuine rotations; at be = 0 explicit F_i = deltas, H_i, deviation 1e-53.\n- N1: (R2delta), (R3) automatic (all columns on three points).\n- lambda2-pencil / composite 3x3: same locus as (R3) (be = 0 or b along e3); no genuine rotation; at (1/2,0,3/2) F_r constant, G_r(lambda2) affine, deviation 1e-53; at genuine (R2delta) points Pf(C0_0 + lambda C1_0) = (const) x lambda not 0.\n\n**Natural measures:** the genuine R2delta columns each admit natural bras (col -1: two with p = 0, col 0: three), always with different w; same-w impossible; col -1 is a product of two 2-point (shift) bras, col 0 contains one 2-point bra; N1 col -1 has none; H in R3 cannot be natural.\n\n**z-independence:** K identical at z' = (3/2,5/4,3/7); loci identical. t-dependence: c = (t-3)/(2(t-2)) in 16(be + al ga) = 43 al^2 -> be + al ga = c al^2, t = theta12/h (8 points, h = 1/2 and 1/3).\n\n**CG reach (Task 7, exact, z = (3/2,5/4,2/3)):** R2delta genuine reaches all 7 adjoint weights / 8 GT states, rank 2 on (1,1,1); R3/pencil (be = 0) reaches 5 weights (not (0,1,2), (0,2,1)), rank 1 on (1,1,1); R1 reaches (2,0,1), (2,1,0) only, rank 0; generic control reaches all, rank 2.\n\n**Notebook state.** VS Code would not execute cells of this file (runCell: 'NOT executed'); every cell was evaluated in the shared kernel from the saved file text, and its printed results were recorded in the markdown cells under the code cells (no native outputs). Setup total about 15 s plus 73 s for the symbolic cell 12.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
